{"3728910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Frequency", "steam_appid": 3728910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Radio Tower in the remote, isolate</strong>d co<strong>untryside is your next assignment. What appears to be a quick repair job quickly spirals into a dreadful ordeal. No one has seen the previous Technician and the Corporation has sent you alone to fix this mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Assignment from your Superiors</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix computer terminals, generators, ventilation systems and transformers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of specialised tools, engineering equipment, scanners, radios and your technical prowess to restore the facility functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're entirely alone - your assignment will only finish once the radio tower is operational. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the Corporation's true purpose for the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search for the previous Technician's whereabouts and uncover their fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the origin of the anomalous activity and learn its true nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever lurks in the darkness - watching and stalking you - threatens to  sabotage your mission. It will not hesitate to seek you out... and annihilate you at any moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, linear horror experience (30 minutes to 1 hour), depending on your thoroughness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meticulously hand-crafted environment decorated with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face up against an adversary that evolves 